{"ID":"20240118151327-v58piqx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151327-v58piqx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151327-v58piqx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151327-dqbx7g9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122091000-4ao716l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122091000-4ao716l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:58,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:58\u0026#125;","title":"065营实（蔷薇子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240129143137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151327-dqbx7g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151327-dqbx7g9","updated":"20240122090918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸温，主痈疽恶创，结肉跌筋，败创热气，阴蚀不瘳，利关节。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090921-s69l82h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090921-s69l82h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，亦名蔷薇，茎多刺，花红色，亦有白色黄色者，子即营实，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090923-tii0oa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090923-tii0oa5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味酸，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090924-jiy2bgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090924-jiy2bgg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】营实主痈疽，下停水。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090926-c0pfmkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090926-c0pfmkc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【效用】营实为清热解毒要药，治痈疽恶疮，热毒阴蚀，蔷薇根能清热生肌，缩尿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090928-r6kwztl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090928-r6kwztl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】蔷薇根主泄痢腹痛、五脏客热，除邪逆气，疽癞诸恶疮，金疮伤打，生肉复肌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090930-ne0sj8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090930-ne0sj8w","updated":"20240122090934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】口舌縻烂，蔷薇根煮汁温含，口疮日久，延及胸前生疮，三年以上不愈者，用此效，杨梅疮筋骨毒痛，取根皮煮汁多饮效，下疳gān用黄花蔷薇叶焙研洗之敷之良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090940-h0twpje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090940-h0twpje"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090937-uh5mojs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090937-uh5mojs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】用以配大黄，行水之效甚著，普通方药罕用之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122090947-d01r5ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090947-d01r5ac"}},{"ID":"20240122090948-xyuid4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090948-xyuid4s"}},{"ID":"20240122090948-y8iwcma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090948-y8iwcma"}},{"ID":"20240122090948-5r17j7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090948-5r17j7g","updated":"20240122090948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第65味药，营实，有一个特殊的地方会用到，那营实呢就是蔷薇，蔷薇花的子，蔷薇花子，蔷薇的子。"}]},{"ID":"20240122090949-spynvtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090949-spynvtc","updated":"20240129142841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主症，是用在一般的生疮啊，里面那个化脓啊，营实的性是酸的，酸主收，收敛，性是温的，温性的药，能够清，因为它是酸收，有伤口开在那边的时候，营实可以收，蔷薇子可以收它，可以把脓水去掉，同时收口，同时把里面的停水清掉，因为我们常常讲清水的时候，是因为伤口上面或疾病上面，不管是癌症或任何的外伤，它有水在，呆在附近的时候，你这个水不清掉，这个光吃那个消炎药不会好的，因为水在那边嘛，炎症随时会回来的，所以我们要去收敛它，营实就可以酸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240122090957-zupv9ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122090957-zupv9ng","updated":"20240129143115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那主要的效用呢，它是清热解毒的药，在【括要】里面有记载的地方最好用，口舌糜烂，口舌里面烂掉的时候，唇口都烂掉，舌头也破洞那个烂掉，那吞东西很痛苦，吞东西也不好吞，这时候我们用营实，就是蔷薇子拿回来，炒过以后，打粉，直接涂在上面就可以了，收口效果很好，收嘴巴的口，那有的人是把蔷薇子拿来煮汤，煮那个汤药，含在嘴巴里面，也可以，都可以，方式很多，那你看，口疮日久，口疮生到胸腔里面生痔疮，长久的疮，陈年老疮都可以用，象杨梅疮讲的就是性病，性病，下疳啊，睾丸变得很大很痛，阴道，那个男人的阴茎糜烂掉，都可以用营实，营实在外涂的，外涂效果很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122091000-4ao716l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122091000-4ao716l","updated":"20240129143137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁忌，如果是有水在里边的时候，可以配一下大黄，其它药很少用，所以营实，外用很多，尤其我在口腔跟性病用得很多，当然我们有内服的药啦。"}]}]}